---
title: Exploration Tick
---
flowchart
    START([Start Tick]) --> Input[/Poll Hardware Input/]
    Input --> InputType{Input Type}
    InputType -->|None / Idle| TickAnim[Update Idle Animations]
    InputType -->|Pause| PAUSE((PAUSE MENU))
    InputType -->|Interact| Interactable?{Is Interactable?}
    InputType -->|Move| Physics{Is Valid Tile?}
    TickAnim --> Render[Flush Framebuffer to Display]
    PAUSE -->|Fast Travel / Close| Render
    Interactable? -->|No| Render
    Interactable? -->|Yes| Interact[Initiate Interaction]
    Interact --> Event?{Triggers Event?}
    Event? -->|No| Encounter?{Triggers Encounter?}
    Encounter? -->|No| Render
    Encounter? -->|Yes| Battle((BATTLE))
    Event? -->|Yes| EVENT
    EVENT --> Encounter?
    Physics -->|Yes| Move[Update Kinematics]
    Move --> LoadArea?{Moves to New Area?}
    LoadArea? -->|No| Event?
    LoadArea? -->|Yes| Load[Lock Input & Load Area]
    Load --> Render
    Physics -->|No| Render
    Battle --> Render
    Render --> END([End Tick])
